# If non-zero, try to write to disk less frequently than we would otherwise.
AvoidDiskWrites 1

# If non-zero, try to use built-in (static) crypto hardware acceleration when available.
HardwareAccel 1

## Pluggable transports
# lyrebird replaces the old obfs4proxy/snowflake-client binaries and provides
# obfs4, meek_lite, webtunnel and snowflake in a single executable.
ClientTransportPlugin meek_lite,obfs2,obfs3,obfs4,scramblesuit,webtunnel exec PluggableTransports/lyrebird
ClientTransportPlugin snowflake exec PluggableTransports/lyrebird
